{
  "slug": "get-design-done",
  "name": "Get Design Done",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent-orchestrated design pipeline for Claude Code. Five stages (brief → discover → plan → design → verify), 33 specialized agents, 12 tool connections including Figma, shadcn/ui, and Magic MCP. Takes a design brief from vague idea to verified, shipped code — with explicit decisions, pattern-mapped plans, and goal-backward audits. Solves the \"Claude made it look fine but nothing ties together\" problem: every token, component, and copy choice is decided, applied, and verified against the original goals.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **58 skills**, **35 agents** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (58): `add-backlog` (Park a design idea for a future cycle), `analyze-dependencies` (Queries the intel store to surface token fan-out, component call-graphs, decision traceability, and circular dependency detection), `apply-reflections` (Review and selectively apply proposals from .design/reflections/<cycle-slug>.md), `audit` (Run design audit — wraps design-verifier + design-auditor + design-reflector), `brief` (Design intake — captures problem statement, audience, constraints, success metrics, and scope into .design/BRIEF.md (Stage 1 of 5)), `cache-manager` (Maintains .design/cache-manifest.json for Layer B explicit cache per D-08), `check-update` (Manual plugin-update check), `compare` (Compute delta between DESIGN.md baseline (from scan) and DESIGN-VERIFICATION.md result (from verify)), and 50 more\n- **Agents** (35): `a11y-mapper` (Maps static accessibility signals — ARIA usage, keyboard nav, focus states, skip links, semantic markup — to .design/map/a11y.md), `component-taxonomy-mapper` (Maps the component inventory — React/Vue/Svelte components, design patterns, reuse opportunities — to .design/map/components.md), `design-advisor` (Researches a single gray area and produces a 5-column comparison table with rationale), `design-assumptions-analyzer` (Reads codebase and DESIGN-CONTEXT.md to surface hidden design assumptions (unstated brand signals, inferred constraints, gray-area candidates) with confidence…), `design-auditor` (Retrospective 6-pillar audit (copy, visual hierarchy, color, typography, layout/spacing, experience) with 1–4 scores), `design-authority-watcher` (Fetches a curated whitelist of design-authority feeds, diffs against .design/authority-snapshot.json, classifies new entries into five buckets, emits .design/authority-report.md), `design-component-generator` (Generates UI components via AI-native design tools (21st.dev Magic MCP or Magic Patterns)), `design-context-builder` (Detects existing design system state via grep/glob, runs discovery interview asking ONLY unanswered questions, produces .design/DESIGN-CONTEXT.md), and 27 more\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install get-design-done@claude-community` from `hegemonart/get-design-done`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 58,
    "agent": 35,
    "hook": 3
  },
